    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>One of the fastest ACPAs the public can buy, and the only one that cares about you. Its Companion Chip reads out tactics, offers encouragement and manages your playlist, and it sulks if you neglect it, which does nothing for performance. Sanroo's pitch is for everyone who ever wanted a robot best friend to wrap them up and carry them away.</em></p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 39,474eb (Super Luxury)<br><strong>Frame / Shell:</strong> Omega / Hybrid Metalgear®<br><strong>Stats:</strong> 35 HP • 16 SP • BODY 16 • +3 MOVE • −1 DEX<br><strong>Onboard weapons:</strong> Captain Cuddlefish Giga Snag-Em, Hello Cutie Pwr-Up Happy Dancer w/ Drum Magazine, SMG Cyclic Internals (Machine Pistol 4) &amp; SMG Short Barrel, Hello Cutie 2TruLuv w/ Sniper Rifle Rechamber &amp; Scout Barrel, Hello Cutie Pwr-Up Thundercat<br><strong>Onboard cyberware:</strong> TUp (+1d6 Damage, 2d6 total) Hello Cutie Mono-Paw, Hello Cutie Sparkle-ize, Kerenzikov, Reflex Co-Processor</p><p>One pilot. The suit's stats modify the pilot's; see the Item Compendium, Power Armor.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Power Armor</small></p>",
